{
  "id": "NUM.31",
  "number": "31",
  "bookId": "NUM",
  "reference": "Kūbala 31",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 54,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "31",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shiilī kūlwa Bamidiani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“A Bamidiani ūkūbamalīla shiilī kūlwa nguno ya Baisilaeli, hanuma ya henaho ūkūtwalwa kū banhū bako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Musa ūbawīla a banhū, “Bamò bing'we zwalīlagi shilanga muje kū būlūgū, kwilwisha na Bamidiani; mukabamalīle shiilī kūlwa ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūmagi banhū shihūmbī shimò kūfuma mu būlī lūganda lwa Baisilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būūsolwa banhū shihūmbī ikūmi na shibīlī kūūfuma ū mu shihūmbī shose ī sha Baisilaeli; banhū shihūmbī shimò būbūūcha shilanga kūfuma mu būlī lūganda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūbatūma a banhū benabo, abo shihūmbī shimò kūfuma mu būlī lūganda; būja ū kū būlūgū hamò nū Finehasi, ū ng'witūnja wa ngabīji Elieza. Ū wei akasola na shikolo shimò na shimò sha ng'wipandī lyeela, hamò na mhembe ja kūfuula ū kū būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakalwa na a Bamidiani, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīla ū Musa; būbabūlaga pye a bagosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu banhū abo bakababūlaga, baalīmo na batemi batanò ba Midiani, ba Evi, Lekemu, Huuli na Leba. Nū Balaamu ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Beoli būmūlaga bo līlūshū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Baisilaeli būbasola a bakīīma ba Bamidiani na a bana, būbīīta kūbiza ding'wa jabo; na a madaale ga ng'ombe na a ga ng'holo būkuminga, pye būjana; hamò nī shikolo ī shingī īsho bakashibona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bīīpemba moto pyī ī mizengo ya Bamidiani nī ng'hambī jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būūtwala kaya pyī ī shikolo īsho bakashisola, nī mitugo; hamò na a banhū abo bakabadima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikolo īsho bakashisola shenīsho, na a banhū abo bakabadima aho bapyena ū mu būlūgū, bakeenha kūlī Musa na ngabīji Elieza, na a Baisilaeli a bangī pye a bose. Baalī kū ng'hambī mu mbūga ya Moabu, hihī na mongo gwa Yolodani; h'ūko baalī bapangile bilola na nzengo gwa Yeliko, gwalī ū kū nkīlo gwa mongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kweejiwa abo baalī babūlaga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa nū Elieza, na a batongeeji ba banhū būja kūbasūng'wanha hanze ya ng'hambī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike aho bashoka ū kūfuma ū ka būlūgū, ū Musa akabapelanīla no a batongeeji; abo baalī bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale shihūmbī shihūmbī, na a ba mabità ga bashilikale igana igana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbabūūja, “Ni kinehe ng'wabalekaga pye a bakīma bikale bapanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno a benaba hū bene abo Balaamu akabanga masala gabūbi ga kūbaduta Baisilaeli; kūshisha bingī būngomela SEEBA gīt'ūmo ng'wīmanīlile ī mihayo ya Peoli, aho banhū ba ng'wa SEEBA bakamalwa ikūla! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū babūlagagi pye a bayanda, na a bakīma abo baamala kūsanja na bagosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhya abo bataalī kūsanja na bagosha a bene balekeelagi babize bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike pye abo ng'wabūlagile banhū, nūūlū kūkuumya mimba gose gose, shiigelile ng'wikale hanze ya ng'hambī ikanza lya shikū mpungatī. Ū mu lūshikū lwa kadatū nū lwa mpungatī mukwiyeeja a bing'we na a babo ng'wabadimile kūfuma kū būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shizwalo shing'we ī shose sheejagi, nī shikolo pyī ī sha kūbeeji kūfuma mu ndīlī, nī sha booya wa mbūli, nī sha mantī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Elieza ūyomba nabo a bashilikale abo baalī baja kū būlūgū; ūbawīa, Ī shilagīlo īsho SEEBA wang'winha Musa shihayile gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ī zahabu, feza, shaba, chūūma, shisīnza, na chūūma sha masaasī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nī shingī pyī īsho shitūdūla kūjiga mu moto, shiigelile sheejiwe mu nzīla ya kūbītiwa mu moto. Alīyo na a minzī a ga kweegeja shiigelile gatūmamīlwe ū kūsheeja. Na būlī shikolo īsho shidūgije kūpya moto shikwejiwa na minzī genayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwa mpungatī mukūfula ī shizwalo shing'we hū ng'ūbiza ng'wela. Ī likanza lyenīlo hū mudūgije ū kūshikīīla ū mu ng'hambī.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūgabanha sha kūding'wa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Musa gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū bebe nū Elieza, hamò na a bataale ba numba ja bakūlūgenji babo, babalagi pye a banhū abo benhilwe kūfuma kū būlūgū, nī mitugo ī nding'wa ījo jenhilwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nding'wa jigabanhyage pyī ī jose; a bashilikale abo baalī baajile ū kūbūlūgū bapandīke, na a banhū a bangī a bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mu sabo jenījo, mukūtīna ibudīka kūlwa nguno ya ng'wa SEEBA; ū mu shikolo īsho shilaaje kū bashilikale, mukūyūsolooja shikolo magana atanò, ng'wīnja mo shikolo shimò. Mukwīta gīko ū kū banhū abo benhilwe, nī ng'ombe, nzobe, ng'holo, pye nī mbūli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īsho mulasole kūfuma ū kwibudīka lya kūja kū bashilikale, mukūshitūūla mu nkono gwa ngabīji Elieza, kūbiza shakwinha kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū ng'wibudīka īlo līlīībagwīla Baisilaeli a bangī, mukūyūsolooja shikolo makūmi atanò, ng'wīnja mo shikolo shimò. Mukwīta gīko ū kū banhū abo benhilwe, nī ng'ombe, nzobe, ng'holo, pye nī mbūli; nūūlū shingī shose shose īsho shenhilwe kūfuma kū būlūgū. Ī shenīsho mukūbinha Balawī, abo bakalang'hanaga ipandī lya kwikala lya ng'wa SEEBA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Musa nū Elieza ū ngabīji bīīta gīt'ūmo SEEBA akanagīīlīlī ū Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu shose īsho shalī sheenhwa kūfuma kū būlūgū, ī libūdīka lya kwanukūla bashilikale lyalī, ng'holo shihūmbī magana atandatū na makūmi mpungatī na shitanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ombe shihūmbī makūmi mpungatī na shibīlī; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nzobe shihūmbī makūmi atandatū na shimò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bakīma abo baalī bataalī kūsanja na bagosha baalī shihūmbī makūmi adatū na shibīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nusu y'ibudīka lya kwanukūla bashilikale līkabiza, ng'holo shihūmbī magana adatū na makūmi adatū na mpungatī, na magana atanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakwinha sha kūja kūlī SEEBA jūbiza ng'holo magana atandatū na makūmi mpungatī n'itanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ombe jalī shihūmbī makūmi adatū na shitandatū; ī shakwinha sha kūja kūlī SEEBA jūbiza ng'ombe makūmi mpungatī n'ibīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nzobe jalī shihūmbī makūmi adatū na magana atanò, ī shakwinha sha kūja kūlī SEEBA jūbiza nzobe makūmi atandatū n'īmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū bakabiza shihūmbī ikūmi na shitandatū, a ba kūja kūlī SEEBA būbiza makūmi adatū na babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūng'winha Elieza ī shakwinha shenīsho, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīla, gīkī ī lyenīlo līkūbiza ibudīka lya ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī libudīka īlo Musa akalīlekanya nī lya bashilikale, ūlīsunda ha mhelo gīkī lībize lya Baisilaeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nusu īyo īkabagwīla a banhū a bose, jalī ng'holo shihūmbī magana adatū na makūmi adatū na mpungatī, na magana atanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī ng'ombe jalī shihūmbī makūmi adatū na shitandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nzobe jalī shihūmbī makūmi adatū na magana atanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū bakabiza shihūmbī ikūmi na shitandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mu nusu ya kūja kū banhū, ū Musa akasola munhū ūmò kūfuma mu būlī makūmi atanò, na ntugo gūmò kūfuma mu būlī mitugo makūmi atanò, gīt'ūmo SEEBA walī wanagīīlīla. Ī shenīsho akabinha Balawī abo bakatūmamaga na kūlīlang'hana ī lipandī lya kwikala lya ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shakwinha sha bataale ba bashilikale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a batongeeji ba bashilikale, abo baalī bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale shihūmbī shihūmbī, na a ba mabità ga bashilikale igana igana, būja ū kūlī Musa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "būng'wīla, “A bise batūmami bako twahayū babala a bashilikale abo balī ha sīlīlī ya būlang'hani wise tūūbona gīkī atajimīīlile nūūlū ūmò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī shikolo sha zahabu īsho būlī ūmò wise wapandīkile, twasheenha shibize shakwinha kūlī SEEBA, kūtūūla isangī kūlwa nguno yise; tūli na bangili ja mu nkono, matendele ga mu nkono, sīīlī ja kū nzwala, sīīlī ja kū matū, na migufu ya mu nhingo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa nū ngabīji Elieza būjanukūla ī zahabu jenījo, ījo jalī jabeejiwa ī shikolo shenīsho kūfuma ū kū banhū benabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī Zahabu ī yose kūfuma ū kū bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale shihūmbī shihūmbī, na a ba mabità ga bashilikale igana igana, īyo Musa na Elieza bakītūūla kūlī SEEBA kūbiza shakwinha, yalī na būdito wa kūkīla ha kilo igana na makūmi anaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bashilikale benabo baalī baashisola ī shikolo shenīsho aho baatinda ū būlūgū; yalī sabo yabo gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Musa nū Elieza būshanukūla ī shikolo shenīsho ū kūfuma ū kū batongeeji benabo, a bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale shihūmbī shihūmbī, na a ba mabità ga bashilikale igana igana, būshenha ū ng'wiheema lya kwibilingīla, būshitūūla ng'wenūmo, kūbiza shizūkījo kūlwa Baisilaeli kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.31.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
